The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository.

The DATA files under worker/data/ have separate terms:

- worker/data/candidates.json is derived from OpenStreetMap and is therefore
  licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
  © OpenStreetMap contributors — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  Any redistribution of this file or works derived from it must carry the
  same attribution and license.

- worker/data/sources.json and worker/data/raw_events.jsonl contain factual
  event data (date, time, venue, price, lineup) gathered from the venues' own
  websites and machine-readable feeds. Facts are not protected by copyright.
  No third-party descriptions or photographs are stored anywhere in this
  repository, by design — see docs/data-policy.md.
